and that reaches stmmac_mac_link_up() -> stmmac_mac_set(priv, priv->ioaddr,
true). The AF_XDP reconfiguration never quiesces phylink:

drivers/net/ethernet/stmicro/stmmac/stmmac_xdp.c:stmmac_xdp_set_prog() {
